  "_doc": "The first king of the island, buried in a coat of fused sand and woken by thieves. P1 \"The Court\": a crowned sword cone, a ring of sand-glass blades he throws around himself, and Sun Through Glass — four glass pillars in the vault are the only shade. P2 at 60% \"The Sealed Court\": he seals himself in glass; light the three grave lamps to break it while his glass guards fight. P3 new bar \"Shattered Crown\": his crown breaks — shards rain all over (scatter), a spreading shard on each player, and a crowned slam that throws everyone back.",
  "party": "Solo: very hard. 2-3: one tank, one lamp runner. 5: as designed — the pillars crack, so share them.",
